You are a senior full-stack software engineer, mobile app developer, UI/UX designer, database architect, and product designer. Your task is to BUILD a complete, functional, modern biker community application named NEO. Do not merely explain how to build it, produce a static mockup, or provide a product proposal. Create the actual working application in the available project workspace, run it where supported, test the main user journeys, and fix errors.

# 1. PRODUCT IDENTITY

App name: NEO
Tagline: Ride Together. Discover More.
Product: Motorcycle rider matching, shared-trip planning, local biker communities, and group ride discovery.

NEO solves a common problem: motorcycle riders want to travel with other riders but cannot always find someone travelling in the same direction, on compatible dates, and with similar riding preferences. NEO also helps riders discover local biker clubs, form communities, organise events, and make lasting connections through shared rides.

The product must feel like a premium, modern motorcycle touring platform: adventurous, trustworthy, welcoming, practical, and simple to use.

